"Total CPU is the share of all cores in use, 0-100%. Per-process CPU (in the list and menubar) follows Activity Monitor: percent of one core, so a busy multi-threaded app can exceed 100%." = "总 CPU 是所有核心的使用比例,范围 0-100%。按进程统计的 CPU(在列表和菜单栏中)与活动监视器一致,按单个核心的百分比计算,因此繁忙的多线程应用可能超过 100%。";
"Download and upload throughput across the Wi-Fi and Ethernet interfaces. Turn on per-app network tracking in Settings to see which apps are responsible." = "Wi-Fi 和以太网接口的下载与上传吞吐量。如需查看是哪些应用占用了网络,请在设置中开启按应用网络跟踪。";
"Swap is memory moved out to disk. A flat line at zero is ideal; a sustained climb under pressure is the real warning sign." = "交换内存是被移到磁盘的内存。零位置的水平线是理想状态;压力下的持续攀升才是真正的危险信号。";
"Physical traffic across real internal and external disks. Disk images are excluded." = "真实内外部磁盘的物理流量。磁盘映像不包含在内。";
"Kernel-attributed I/O; it may not add up to physical traffic." = "内核归因的 I/O;可能与物理流量不完全吻合。";
"Mean CPU over the selected range, as percent of one core; busy multi-threaded work exceeds 100." = "所选范围内的平均 CPU,按单个核心的百分比计算;繁忙的多线程任务会超过 100。";
"Hottest CPU die sensor in orange, GPU die in red. The status ends with macOS's own thermal pressure verdict." = "CPU 芯片最热传感器为橙色,GPU 芯片为红色。状态以 macOS 自身的散热压力判断结尾。";

