/* ===== OnboardingView ===== */

"Skip" = "跳过";
"Get started" = "开始使用";
"Next" = "下一步";
"Watch pressure, not free RAM" = "关注压力,而非空闲内存";
"On Apple silicon, almost no RAM is ever \u{201C}free\u{201D}, and that is normal. macOS keeps memory busy on purpose. What matters is memory pressure: how hard the system is working to keep up. %@ puts that front and centre." = "在 Apple 芯片上,几乎没有任何内存是真正“空闲”的,这完全正常。macOS 有意让内存保持繁忙。真正重要的是内存压力:系统为跟上需求付出了多大努力。%@ 将这一指标放在最核心的位置。";
"Cached files are a good thing" = "缓存文件是好事";
"Much of your \u{201C}used\u{201D} memory is cached files: recently used data kept around to make things fast. macOS hands it back the instant something needs it. %@ shows cached files in a calm colour so you know it is working for you, not against you." = "您大部分“已用”内存实际上是缓存文件:保留最近使用的数据以提升速度。一旦有程序需要,macOS 会立即归还这部分内存。%@ 用平缓的颜色显示缓存文件,让您知道它是在为您服务,而不是拖慢系统。";
"Compression and swap are the real signals" = "压缩与交换内存才是真正的信号";
"When pressure stays high, macOS compresses memory and then writes to swap. A little is fine; a lot, sustained, is the sign that something is asking for too much. %@ watches these trends and points to the process responsible." = "当内存压力持续偏高时,macOS 会先压缩内存,然后写入交换文件。少量压缩完全正常;但大量且持续的压缩与交换,才表明某些程序索取了过多资源。%@ 持续监测这些趋势并指出责任进程。";
"Choose how it runs" = "选择运行方式";
"You can switch anytime: in Settings or from the menu bar." = "您可以随时切换 , 在设置中或从菜单栏。";
